  spkrxts:
  - Hello again, it's me - the person who delivered to you earlier
  - Ah, you...why are you still here?
  - I got a call saying my packages fell around here
  - That's bad
  - You've been caught
  - By who?
  - Them
  - The residents
  - Sorry, I can't help you
  - I'd be in danger
  - Then where the hell do I go? I'll die out here!
  - The tower
  - You'll survive there
  - Take this GPS
  - Good luck
  - ...
  - Thanks
